WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:03.837
Mark S:
Every time you find yourself
here, it's because you chose to come back.

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:08.550
(Wind howling)

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:12.804
♪♪

00:00:12.804 --> 00:00:15.349
Hello, My name is Mark S.

00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:16.475
♪♪

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:19.269
Mark S:
And I have of my own free accord

00:00:19.269 --> 00:00:21.688
Mark S:
elected to undergo the procedure

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:24.149
known as Severance.
(Ding)

00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:31.448
♪♪

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:35.661
Mark S:
I give consent to sever my
memories between my work life

00:00:37.621 --> 00:00:38.622
Mark S:
and my personal life.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:40.249
(Outdoor noise and birds
chirping)

00:00:40.666 --> 00:00:43.835
Mark S:
I acknowledge that once the
procedure is complete

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:46.546
Mark S:
I will be unable to access my
personal memories

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.590
Mark S:
whilst on the severed floor.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:49.716
Milchick:
Say gratitude.

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:50.425
(Camera click)

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:52.219
Mark S:
Nor will I retain work
memories...

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:52.636
(Tires skidding)

00:00:52.636 --> 00:00:53.262
Helly:
Hey!

00:00:53.804 --> 00:00:54.429
Sorry.

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:57.140
Mark S:
...when I return home at the end
of the day.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:59.393
♪♪

00:00:59.393 --> 00:01:00.602
I make these statements freely.

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:03.897
♪♪

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:04.773
Irving:
Hi, kids,

00:01:04.773 --> 00:01:05.482
Irving:
what's for dinner?

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:06.316
Dylan:
We warned you...

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:06.984
About the greeting?

00:01:06.984 --> 00:01:07.734
You were kidding.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:08.277
Dylan:
We hate it.

00:01:08.277 --> 00:01:09.653
How many reasons did we come up
with?

00:01:09.653 --> 00:01:10.195
Eight.

00:01:10.195 --> 00:01:10.988
(Knocking on door)

00:01:10.988 --> 00:01:11.947
Good morning.

00:01:11.947 --> 00:01:12.906
Hi, Mr. Milchick.

00:01:12.906 --> 00:01:14.032
Mark, could I have a word?

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:17.452
Petey, is no longer with this
company.

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:20.914
Milchick:
I'm sorry Mark, you guys were
one of my favorite office friendships.

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:21.790
What happened?

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:25.210
We'd love to tell you, but
unfortunately non-disclosure
policy forbids.

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:28.213
I confer upon you the advance
role of department chief.

00:01:28.213 --> 00:01:29.423
Ms. Cobel:
Congratulations.

00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:31.800
A handshake is available upon
request.

00:01:32.551 --> 00:01:34.136
Thank you, may I have a
handshake?

00:01:37.681 --> 00:01:38.390
(Rewind noise)

00:01:38.390 --> 00:01:46.148
♪♪

00:01:46.148 --> 00:01:46.857
Do I know you?

00:01:47.149 --> 00:01:48.650
My name is Petey, I'm from work.

00:01:49.943 --> 00:01:51.528
Mark S:
So we're friends?

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:53.030
Petey:
I'm your best friend.

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:57.075
Petey:
Nothing is what they say.

00:01:58.076 --> 00:02:02.164
Petey:
I used to think it would take a
monster to put someone in a place like that office.

00:02:03.206 --> 00:02:05.375
Petey:
Especially if the person was
himself.

00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:06.877
♪♪

00:02:06.877 --> 00:02:09.046
Petey:
If you want to know what's
going on down there...

00:02:09.046 --> 00:02:10.839
♪♪

00:02:10.839 --> 00:02:14.051
Petey:
...you'll find the beginning of a
very long answer.

00:02:14.051 --> 00:02:16.928
♪♪

00:02:16.928 --> 00:02:17.596
Helly:
What's happening?

00:02:18.347 --> 00:02:23.769
♪♪

00:02:23.769 --> 00:02:25.771
Mark S:
What is it we actually do here?

00:02:27.606 --> 00:02:30.108
♪ Daydream I fell asleep ♪

00:02:30.108 --> 00:02:32.110
Milchick:
It's important your eyes be
kind.

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:34.404
Milchick:
Do you know how to make your
eyes kind?

00:02:34.404 --> 00:02:35.906
♪♪

00:02:35.906 --> 00:02:38.408
♪ On a beautiful day ♪

00:02:38.408 --> 00:02:41.995
♪♪

